  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Hi @mingfeima , this re-enables the Xeon test you disabled in #43468 — the 2026-10-24 deadline has passed and the CUDA-only vsa import now works cleanly on CPU-only boxes. The fixtures had drifted while the test was off (validate_server_args now reads performance_mode), so I fixed those too — 31 passed + 7 subtests on a CPU box against current main. Would you mind taking a look when you get a chance? Also, could you add a run-ci label so CI can actually exercise it? Thanks!",
